  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An ongoing cooperation between Sweden and Bosnia-Hercegovina with the purpose to support continued peace, the reconciliation, the democraticdevelopment and a socially sustainable economic transformation. This project comprises i.a. education of personnel in social work at university level, education in psychiatry and in child psychiatry.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett fortsatt samarbete mellan Sverige och Bosnien-Hercegovina i syfte att bl a st&#xF6;dja fortsatt fred, f&#xF6;rsoning, demokratisk utvecklingoch socialt h&#xE5;llbar ekonomisk omvandling. I denna insats ing&#xE5;r bl a: fortbildning i socialt arbete av personal p&#xE5; universitetsniv&#xE5;, fort- bildning i &#xF6;ppenv&#xE5;rdspsykiatri, utveckling av barnpsykiatri.</narrative>
  </description>
